      "paloalto-panos": "set shared server-profile tacplus ISE protocol CHAP\nset shared server-profile tacplus ISE server S1 address {{tacacs_server}}\nset shared server-profile tacplus ISE server S1 secret <secret>\nset shared server-profile tacplus ISE server S1 port 49\nset shared authentication-profile TACACS method tacplus server-profile ISE\nset shared authentication-profile TACACS allow-list all\nset mgt-config users <tacacs-admin> permissions role-based superuser yes\nset mgt-config users <tacacs-admin> authentication-profile TACACS\ncommit\n# An authentication profile with an empty allow-list rejects every login, hence 'allow-list all'.\n# Device > Setup > Management > Authentication Settings applies one profile to all administrators;\n# keep one local break-glass superuser with a local password so a TACACS+ outage cannot lock you out.",
      generic: "Enable the AAA framework and bind administrator logins to it.",
