      "mikrotik-routeros": "# Create the interface list first if it does not exist (/interface list print):\n/interface list add name=WAN\n/interface list member add interface=<wan-interface> list=WAN\n/ip firewall filter add chain=input connection-state=established,related action=accept comment=\"established\"\n/ip firewall filter add chain=input connection-state=invalid action=drop comment=\"invalid\"\n/ip firewall filter add chain=input src-address={{mgmt_subnet_cidr}} action=accept comment=\"management\"\n/ip firewall filter add chain=input in-interface-list=WAN action=drop log=yes log-prefix=\"INPUT-DROP\" comment=\"deny from WAN\"",
      generic: "Apply an inbound access list on the external interface that drops bogon/private sources.",
